  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine beef shin, fish sauce, salt, and black pepper, and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat oil in the ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced long green chili and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the marinated beef shin and cook until browned.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let it cook for 1 1/2 hours, or until the beef is tender.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped green onions and steamed rice on the side."
